      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITZA RINGER (2) has been hard to follow lately, running fifth (30.90) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Will find this more suitable and can atone. GOT STYLE (1) comes off an average run last start when seventh at Q Parklands over 600m behind Silver Moon (35.68) in a Grade 5/6. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Has ability and can measure up. GORDON KEEPING (8) turned in a moderate run last time when sixth at Q Parklands over 520m behind Gonzo (30.63) in a Restricted WIN. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. DAYSEA'S SHELLY (6) finished in the placings last start and deserves some thought.",
